'' A MODULE'S TYPE ALIASES ARE RESOLVED BEFORE ITS BODIES (RFC-0003 §5). a.tiko types a
'' field 'Widget ptr' and calls 'w->Get( )' and 'w->Twice'; 'type Widget as Widget_' is in
'' b.tiko, which sorts after it. The alias still held its placeholder when the body was
'' resolved, so both calls bound nothing, lowered to nothing, and the function's 'ret void'
'' stopped clang (fbx/scripting's m_pDictionary->Release). The IMPORTER reads the interface
'' in the same order, so its call to 'Peek( byval p as Widget ptr )' named Peek(void*), which
'' nothing defines (fbx/adodb's event sink).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/aliaslater/libs tests/modules/src/aliaslater/main.bas -o tests/modules/aliaslater.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/aliaslater.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  42
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  14
